<mj-text><strong>Don't miss out on the second pillar tax benefit</strong></mj-text>
<mj-text>
  Second pillar contributions are exempt from income tax: the bigger the contribution, the
  greater the benefit. For example, with a 2,000 euro gross salary, a 6% contribution gives
  you a tax benefit of 316 euros per year.
</mj-text>
<mj-text><strong>See how big your tax benefit would be if you raised your contribution:</strong></mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/2nd-pillar-tax-win?utm_content=nudge_payment_rate">Check it out</mj-button>
